---
import Layout from '../../layouts/CommercialLayout.astro';
---
<Layout lang="en" page="home" title="Smart charging and energy management for your site" description="Charge more vehicles within your existing grid connection. Stroomlijnen connects smart charging, solar and storage in one energy management system." showClosing={false}>
 <div class="home-story">
  <section class="story-hero shell" aria-labelledby="home-title">
   <div class="story-hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Smart charging · energy management</p>
    <h1 id="home-title">Your business grows.<br/><em>So does demand.</em></h1>
    <p class="story-intro">More electric vehicles, the same grid connection. Smart charging and energy management from Stroomlijnen keep capacity available for your business and help you control energy costs.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/en/contact/">Discuss your site <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a class="story-scroll" href="#werkdag"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span> Discover how it works</a>
   </div>
   <figure class="story-hero-image site-illustration">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 600 530" role="img" aria-labelledby="site-title site-desc">
     <title id="site-title">Your site as one energy system</title><desc id="site-desc">A business building with solar panels, battery storage and chargers, connected through one EMS.</desc>
     <rect width="600" height="530" fill="var(--mist)"/>
     <g fill="none" stroke="var(--navy)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M88 270V148L300 92L510 148V270ZM88 148L300 205L510 148M300 205V327L510 270M88 270L300 327"/>
      <path d="M135 145L295 104L449 145L290 188ZM188 131L344 172M241 118L397 158M187 159L347 118M240 174L398 132" fill="var(--cyan)" fill-opacity=".15"/>
      <path d="M119 184L162 196V242L119 230ZM187 203L230 215V261L187 249ZM340 219L390 205V254L340 268ZM422 197L472 183V232L422 246"/>
      <rect x="70" y="350" width="58" height="87" rx="5" fill="var(--white, #fff)"/><path d="M83 369H115M83 383H115M83 397H115"/>
      <rect x="448" y="350" width="40" height="87" rx="5" fill="var(--white, #fff)"/><path d="M458 366H478V385H458ZM488 378Q521 378 521 408V424Q521 440 506 440"/>
      <path d="M161 436V407L182 389H261L285 410V436ZM182 399H256L269 412H170M194 399V412M235 399V412" fill="var(--white, #fff)"/><circle cx="185" cy="438" r="11" fill="var(--white, #fff)"/><circle cx="261" cy="438" r="11" fill="var(--white, #fff)"/>
     </g>
     <g fill="none" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 7"><path d="M300 278V361M128 393H296M356 393H448"/></g>
     <rect x="296" y="363" width="60" height="60" rx="30" fill="var(--navy)"/>
     <g font-family="Inter,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="15" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--navy)"><text x="300" y="66">Solar</text><text x="470" y="305">Building</text><text x="99" y="473">Storage</text><text x="468" y="473">Charging</text><text x="326" y="399" fill="var(--white, #fff)">EMS</text></g>
    </svg>
    <figcaption><span>Your site as one energy system</span><span>Simplified illustration</span></figcaption>
   </figure>
  </section>
  <nav class="story-chapters shell" aria-label="From your working day to a charging plan that fits"><a href="#werkdag">01 / Your working day</a><a href="#energie">02 / Room to charge</a><a href="#sectoren">03 / Your site</a></nav>

  <section id="werkdag" class="story-problem shell story-section" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
   <div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">01 / Your working day</p><h2 id="problem-title">Everything comes together.<br/>On one grid connection.</h2><p class="story-intro">Your vehicles need to charge while your business needs power. But your grid connection is limited and upgrading it is expensive. Energy prices fluctuate, and solar goes unused when generation and demand do not align.</p></div>
   <div class="story-day" data-reveal>
    <p class="story-small-label">What a working day could look like</p>
    <ol>
     <li data-reveal><time>08:00</time><div><h3>Vehicles arrive</h3><p>The first vehicles plug in as the building starts up.</p></div><span class="day-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
     <li data-reveal><time>11:00</time><div><h3>Business is busy</h3><p>The kitchen, climate control or production needs power; charging adapts.</p></div><span class="day-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
     <li data-reveal><time>14:00</time><div><h3>Room to charge</h3><p>Solar power goes to vehicles that will stay a little longer.</p></div><span class="day-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
     <li data-reveal><time>22:00</time><div><h3>Ready for tomorrow</h3><p>If the tariff is favourable, the remaining vehicles charge before their next trip.</p></div><span class="day-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="story-fine">An illustrative working day, not measured data.</p>
   </div>
  </section>

  <section id="energie" class="story-energy" aria-labelledby="energy-title">
   <div class="shell story-section">
    <div class="story-energy-intro" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Room to charge</p><h2 id="energy-title">Charging, solar and storage.<br/><em>Managed together.</em></h2></div><p>The Stroomlijnen energy management system (EMS) coordinates your chargers with the building, solar generation and battery storage where available. It keeps your site within the agreed connection limit and works to lower energy costs. One platform, one dashboard, one partner.</p></div>
    <figure class="story-flow" data-reveal>
     <svg class="flow-wide" viewBox="0 0 1000 350" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-title flow-desc">
      <title id="flow-title">Sharing power across your site</title><desc id="flow-desc">A grid connection supplies local power management. It adjusts charging to building demand, within the available capacity.</desc>
      <defs><pattern id="flow-dots" width="24" height="24" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r="1" fill="#304054"/></pattern></defs>
      <rect width="1000" height="350" fill="url(#flow-dots)"/>
      <g fill="none" stroke="#3d5369" stroke-width="2"><path d="M180 175H400M540 175H625Q650 175 650 150V95H785M650 150V255H785"/></g>
      <g class="energy-traces" fill="none" stroke-width="3"><path d="M180 175H400"/><path d="M540 175H625Q650 175 650 150V95H785"/><path d="M540 175H625Q650 175 650 200V255H785"/></g>
      <g stroke="#e6edf4" stroke-width="2" fill="#0a1628" stroke-linejoin="round">
       <rect x="100" y="133" width="80" height="84" rx="3"/><path d="M124 153V174M155 153V174M124 164H155M140 174V198"/>
       <rect x="400" y="130" width="140" height="90" rx="45" stroke="#00b0e4"/><path d="M441 175H499M452 160V190M487 160V190" stroke="#00b0e4"/><circle cx="452" cy="168" r="5" fill="#00b0e4"/><circle cx="487" cy="183" r="5" fill="#00b0e4"/>
       <path d="M785 119V73L825 54L865 73V119ZM797 119V81H853V119M814 119V94H836V119M807 81V119M843 81V119"/>
       <path d="M785 230H839V271H785ZM839 244H856L872 257V271H839"/><path d="M846 250H854L863 258H846Z"/>
       <circle cx="802" cy="273" r="9"/><circle cx="855" cy="273" r="9"/>
      </g>
      <circle class="charge-signal" cx="871" cy="229" r="5" fill="#84bd00"/>
      <g class="flow-labels" fill="#f2f5f8" text-anchor="middle"><text x="140" y="250">Your connection</text><text x="470" y="253">Your EMS</text><text x="826" y="151">Your building</text><text x="826" y="313">Your vehicles</text></g>
     </svg>
     <svg class="flow-compact" viewBox="0 0 360 380" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-mobile-title flow-mobile-desc">
      <title id="flow-mobile-title">Sharing power across your site</title><desc id="flow-mobile-desc">A grid connection supplies local power management. It adjusts charging to building demand, within the available capacity.</desc>
      <g fill="none" stroke="#3d5369" stroke-width="2"><path d="M180 74V81M180 112V145M180 205V246H85V285M180 246H275V285"/></g>
      <g class="energy-traces" fill="none" stroke-width="3"><path d="M180 74V81M180 112V145"/><path d="M180 205V246H85V285"/><path d="M180 205V246H275V285"/></g>
      <g fill="#0a1628" stroke="#e6edf4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round">
       <rect x="155" y="20" width="50" height="54" rx="2"/><path d="M170 33V48M190 33V48M170 42H190M180 48V61"/>
       <rect x="115" y="145" width="130" height="60" rx="30" stroke="#00b0e4"/>
       <path d="M65 329V297L85 285L105 297V329ZM73 329V304H97V329M81 329V313H89V329"/>
       <path d="M242 289H281V320H242ZM281 300H295L307 311V320H281"/><circle cx="254" cy="322" r="7"/><circle cx="295" cy="322" r="7"/>
      </g>
      <g fill="#f2f5f8" font-size="13" font-family="Inter,Arial,sans-serif" text-anchor="middle"><text x="180" y="101">Your connection</text><text x="180" y="180">Your EMS</text><text x="85" y="357">Your building</text><text x="275" y="357">Your vehicles</text></g>
     </svg>
     <figcaption><span>Simply put: available power is shared between your building and chargers.</span><span>Simplified illustration · possibilities vary by site</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ol class="story-steps">
     <li data-reveal><span>01</span><div><h3>Stay within your connection</h3><p>The EMS allocates available power. When demand in your building rises, vehicles temporarily charge more slowly.</p></div></li>
     <li data-reveal><span>02</span><div><h3>Use more of your solar</h3><p>Charge vehicles when your panels are generating. A battery lets you save surplus energy for later.</p></div></li>
     <li data-reveal><span>03</span><div><h3>Charge at favourable times</h3><p>Departure times and energy tariffs help determine when to charge. You can see consumption and charging sessions in one dashboard.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
   </div>
  </section>

  <section id="sectoren" class="story-applications" aria-labelledby="applications-title">
   <div class="shell story-section">
    <div class="story-app-intro" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">03 / Your site</p><h2 id="applications-title">Your industry.<br/>Your working day.</h2><p>A hotel has different peaks from a distribution centre. We tailor power allocation to your site, vehicles and operations.</p></div>
    <div class="story-application-list">
     <a href="/en/contact/" data-reveal><svg class="sector-visual" viewBox="0 0 104 96" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 76V28H76V76M12 76H92M32 40H40M56 40H64M32 52H40M56 52H64M44 76V62H56V76M76 52H88V76"/><path d="M8 88H96" stroke="var(--cyan)"/></svg><div><h3>Hospitality</h3><p>Guests charge during their stay while the kitchen and climate control retain enough power.</p></div><span class="story-application-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
     <a href="/en/contact/" data-reveal><svg class="sector-visual" viewBox="0 0 104 96" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 30H60V68H12ZM60 44H78L92 58V68H60M68 50H76L83 58H68ZM28 76a8 8 0 1 0 0-16 8 8 0 0 0 0 16M76 76a8 8 0 1 0 0-16 8 8 0 0 0 0 16"/><path d="M8 88H96" stroke="var(--cyan)"/></svg><div><h3>Transport & logistics</h3><p>Your fleet charges within available capacity, timed around its next departures.</p></div><span class="story-application-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
     <a href="/en/contact/" data-reveal><svg class="sector-visual" viewBox="0 0 104 96" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 78V24H50V78M50 42H84V78M8 78H92M26 36H38M26 48H38M26 60H38M60 54H72M60 66H72"/><path d="M8 88H96" stroke="var(--cyan)"/></svg><div><h3>Property & facilities</h3><p>You share power between tenants, building systems and chargers at the same site.</p></div><span class="story-application-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
     <a href="/en/contact/" data-reveal><svg class="sector-visual" viewBox="0 0 104 96" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 78V46L36 32V46L60 32V50H88V78ZM72 50V20H82V50M24 62H32M44 62H52M66 62H76"/><path d="M8 88H96" stroke="var(--cyan)"/></svg><div><h3>Industry</h3><p>Charging and battery storage adapt to your production peaks and solar generation.</p></div><span class="story-application-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <details class="story-kit" data-reveal><summary>The charger follows your working day <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="story-kit-body"><dl><div><dt>Fixed DC charger</dt><dd><strong>120 kW</strong><p>Expandable to 160 kW with an additional 40 kW module.</p></dd></div><div><dt>AC · longer stays</dt><dd><strong>22 kW</strong></dd></div><div><dt>Mobile DC · on site</dt><dd><strong>30 kW</strong></dd></div></dl><p>Vehicle recognition via EVCCID/MAC, where supported by the vehicle and charger.</p><p class="story-fine">Nominal ratings. Actual charging power depends on the vehicle and site.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://docs.stroomlijnen.nl/en/">Explore our documentation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></details>
   </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-contact shell story-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
   <div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">The next step starts with a conversation</p><h2 id="contact-title">More charging.<br/><em>What can your site do?</em></h2></div>
   <div class="story-contact-copy" data-reveal><p>Tell us about your connection, vehicles and energy use. Together, we will explore where smart charging, solar and storage can free up capacity and reduce costs.</p><a class="button" href="/en/contact/">Discuss your site <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="story-docs"><p>Want the technical details?</p><a class="text-link" href="https://docs.stroomlijnen.nl/en/">Explore our documentation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
  </section>
 </div>
</Layout>
<script>
 import '../../scripts/home-story';
</script>

<style>
 .story-hero h1 { width:100%; font-size:clamp(2.8rem,4.7vw,4.6rem); }
 .site-illustration>svg { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }
 .story-application-list>a { grid-template-columns:80px 1fr 25px; align-items:center; }
 .sector-visual { width:80px; height:auto; color:var(--navy); }
 @media(max-width:760px) {
  .story-hero h1 { font-size:clamp(2.5rem,8vw,4rem); }
  .story-application-list>a { grid-template-columns:60px 1fr 20px; gap:14px; }
  .sector-visual { width:60px; }
 }
</style>
